<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-SCHALKE V TENERIFE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCHALKE V TENERIFE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>GELSENKIRCHEN, Germany 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for</p>
<p>Tuesday's UEFA Cup semifinal second leg between Schalke of</p>
<p>Germany and Tenerife of Spain:</p>
<p>Schalke: 1-Jens Lehmann; 10-Olaf Thon, 25-Johan de Kock,</p>
<p>2-Thomas Linke, 4-Yves Eigenrauch, 20-Jiri Nemec; 6-Andreas</p>
<p>Mueller, 8-Ingo Anderbruegge, 19-Mike Bueskens; 3-Radoslav</p>
<p>Latal, 24-Marc Wilmots.</p>
<p>Tenerife: 13-Beng Andersson; 3-Alexis Suarez, 4-Pablo Paz,</p>
<p>12-Sergio Ballesteros, 5-Antonio Mata, 8-Chano Cruzado; 26-Sizwe</p>
<p>Motaung, 10-Felipe Minambres, 6-Slavisa Jokanovic; 9-Meho Kodro,</p>
<p>16-Antonio Pinilla.</p>
</text>
